<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's N&amp;T sells tanker.</title>
<headline>Sweden's N&amp;T sells tanker.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Nordstrom &amp; Thulin said it has sold the M/T Nord Jahre President tanker to an American buyer for $31 million.</p>
<p>The 97,000-ton vessel was built in 1989 and will be delivered to its new owner in August 1997. N&amp;T said it is aiming to renew its fleet with medium sized tankers.</p>
<p>&quot;Discussions have been initiated which may result in deals within the coming months,&quot; Nordstrom &amp; Thulin said in a statement. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
